  "notes": "Fixed source-input model, not runtime telemetry. The baseline is recorded by --write-baseline at the measuring change's own starting commit, so a report counts that change alone. The startup route is what every session reads before the first message: AGENTS.md (the WONG-STACK block and the rest of CLAUDE.md), the wiki style and voice pages it imports, and skill-descriptions, every SKILL.md description joined; the memory digest is excluded. startupCeiling caps that route; raising it is a recorded decision. The inventory is every skill folder but the vendored agent-browser, plus the owner list. Save routes include meaningful fact capture but no spec deltas. Cold resume measures orientation. Change-specific artifacts, implementation context, and repeated agent invocations vary and are excluded. Route files are counted once."
